#NEXUS

[ yu2020a_fig3: Ornithischian strict consensus, time-scaled. Branch topology read from the PDF's vector branch lines (identical at snapping tolerances 0.4-1.5 pt; the Jeholosaurus branch is drawn twice and counted once); tip names assigned in top-to-bottom order from the printed labels, which sit too close together for line-by-line text matching. No clade names printed. 73 tips, 4 polytomies (7, 3, 11, 3 children). Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology read from the PDF's own vector branch lines and checked against the figure; topology only. ]

